{"content_id": "7188b66ef5824e81ed88313aeff8bbafc94dc03bd6cce493853d2908d87225f3", "display_order": 1, "key": "ZETTEL::BMC-MESS-001", "label": "instability-by-subtraction", "node_type": "ZETTEL", "title": "Black Mountain College did not merely suffer instability; it removed several of the devices institutions normally use to suppress it."}
